{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/c2d6bafbc1f162633122e9aba530a0a2.avif?t=1770674422\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras_big/c2d6bafbc1f162633122e9aba530a0a2.avif?t=1770674422 width=800 height=496 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conductor Cat is a 3D platformer <strong>about gathering scrap to engineer creative solutions.</strong> You play as Griffin\u2014a cat who currently lives in the faraway town of Matador. He ran away from home as a child and was raised under the supervision of a conductor named Mr. Marco. Twenty years later, he receives a letter from his mother. His father is sick and will likely pass away soon. Griffin is conflicted but embarks on a long journey back to his home country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ef76ff8cb056d3dd4933baa83a608d8c.poster.avif?t=1770674422\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ef76ff8cb056d3dd4933baa83a608d8c.webm?t=1770674422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ef76ff8cb056d3dd4933baa83a608d8c.mp4?t=1770674422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tracks aren't what they used to be! Griffin must use all of his skills and tools available to him to get back home. He must scavenge, collect, and build to keep his train going. His train consists of a <strong>fast locomotive</strong>, a <strong>spacious storage car</strong>, and a <strong>versatile craft car</strong>\u00a0that will help him build whatever he needs. Apart from the train, Griffin is agile and nimble. He can scurry up walls, grind on rails, and glide to where he needs to.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/a63e98e683af9beba7a1dc9f4f56a2b8.poster.avif?t=1770674422\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/a63e98e683af9beba7a1dc9f4f56a2b8.webm?t=1770674422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/a63e98e683af9beba7a1dc9f4f56a2b8.mp4?t=1770674422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2671980?t=1770674422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2671980?t=1770674422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/9a86b868517910c47de97510df30eefac2840809/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770674422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/9a86b868517910c47de97510df30eefac2840809/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770674422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/c2d6bafbc1f162633122e9aba530a0a2.avif?t=1770674422\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras_big/c2d6bafbc1f162633122e9aba530a0a2.avif?t=1770674422 width=80